Result: **CONCERNS / LEGIT**.

The proof reconstructs with fresh `#Top`, pins the submitted function, and rejects a false postcondition. The principal concern is the absence of a bridge-free universal K theorem for the otherwise mathematically sound slice rule; generation metadata is also missing.

- [Full review](/audit-output/REVIEW.md)
- [Evidence index](/audit-output/evidence/INDEX.md)
